{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Falling Star</strong> is a short, atmospheric <strong>first-person narrative adventure</strong> set in a fragmented dreamscape. You play as a young girl, journeying through a surreal memory world shaped by grief, love, and unanswered questions. After your mother\u2019s passing, you follow her final wish\u2014to uncover the truth behind your missing Aunt Jiang, and in doing so, begin to understand the family stories left unspoken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras/491ce5a36600980875ef86b51a3a6b7a.avif?t=1772087423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras_big/491ce5a36600980875ef86b51a3a6b7a.avif?t=1772087423 width=800 height=372 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Short, Emotional Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be completed in around <strong>20\u201330 minutes</strong>, <i>The Falling Star</i> offers a focused, emotionally resonant experience. Perfect for players who enjoy introspective storytelling and atmospheric exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Dreamlike World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through beautifully crafted environments that blur the line between memory and imagination. From quiet bedrooms to abandoned factories and the remains of a once-bustling town, each area reflects pieces of the past waiting to be pieced together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras/b7d3c7a0707ebc9d9a160d8101103e76.avif?t=1772087423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras_big/b7d3c7a0707ebc9d9a160d8101103e76.avif?t=1772087423 width=800 height=372 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Environmental Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover clues hidden in the world\u2014handwritten notes, old objects, and family relics. Light puzzle-solving is used to guide your journey and encourage thoughtful exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Story Told Through Objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of lengthy cutscenes, the narrative unfolds through <strong>environmental storytelling</strong>. Examine everyday items and listen to the protagonist\u2019s inner thoughts as she reflects on her family\u2019s history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras/3f0e1ba76b5bb243e0f9552cb269d475.avif?t=1772087423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras_big/3f0e1ba76b5bb243e0f9552cb269d475.avif?t=1772087423 width=800 height=372 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Meditative Soundscape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by original gentle music and ambient sound design, the experience invites players to slow down, feel, and remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras/bc20e5763dd8a0f49d97ebe2a799e923.avif?t=1772087423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras_big/bc20e5763dd8a0f49d97ebe2a799e923.avif?t=1772087423 width=800 height=368 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you appreciate <strong>narrative-driven games</strong> like <i>What Remains of Edith Finch</i>, <i>Gone Home</i>, or <i>To the Moon</i>, <i>The Falling Star</i> offers a similarly heartfelt tale in a compact and accessible format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat. No time limits. Just you, your memories, and the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase the star, while you still can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras/c3ad1800a4663645b7cb6600d6841d46.avif?t=1772087423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras_big/c3ad1800a4663645b7cb6600d6841d46.avif?t=1772087423 width=800 height=372 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Among the Falling Stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3706430/d400cd4f8c83d0db3ef5e2fe2bfccfcb4dfec29f.jpg"},{"name":"Once Upon A Time...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3706430/a51dae008f98b3e9697d9951764ad33fa74a9b87.jpg"},{"name":"A Family Story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3706430/72b444ea6c6fc2e68908cfdecb471f864f8a8555.jpg"},{"name":"Busy Morning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3706430/e25b364635c3bc5b5b1f11c45b97f76f083f6745.jpg"},{"name":"Ready Meal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3706430/7f1624c8f26c66fa606fa7da584e8a11720bca07.jpg"},{"name":"Perfectly Ordinary ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3706430/305c34b15f09466341ce8e2a8332a7289db47fe7.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706430?t=1772087423","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706430?t=1772087423","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/8c0fd701a83b93201290d0bec07163fb1221cbad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772087423","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/8c0fd701a83b93201290d0bec07163fb1221cbad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772087423","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Falling Star</strong> is a short, atmospheric <strong>first-person narrative adventure</strong> set in a fragmented dreamscape. You play as a young girl, journeying through a surreal memory world shaped by grief, love, and unanswered questions. After your mother\u2019s passing, you follow her final wish\u2014to uncover the truth behind your missing Aunt Jiang, and in doing so, begin to understand the family stories left unspoken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras/491ce5a36600980875ef86b51a3a6b7a.avif?t=1772087423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras_big/491ce5a36600980875ef86b51a3a6b7a.avif?t=1772087423 width=800 height=372 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Short, Emotional Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be completed in around <strong>20\u201330 minutes</strong>, <i>The Falling Star</i> offers a focused, emotionally resonant experience. Perfect for players who enjoy introspective storytelling and atmospheric exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Dreamlike World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through beautifully crafted environments that blur the line between memory and imagination. From quiet bedrooms to abandoned factories and the remains of a once-bustling town, each area reflects pieces of the past waiting to be pieced together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras/b7d3c7a0707ebc9d9a160d8101103e76.avif?t=1772087423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras_big/b7d3c7a0707ebc9d9a160d8101103e76.avif?t=1772087423 width=800 height=372 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Environmental Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover clues hidden in the world\u2014handwritten notes, old objects, and family relics. Light puzzle-solving is used to guide your journey and encourage thoughtful exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Story Told Through Objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of lengthy cutscenes, the narrative unfolds through <strong>environmental storytelling</strong>. Examine everyday items and listen to the protagonist\u2019s inner thoughts as she reflects on her family\u2019s history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras/3f0e1ba76b5bb243e0f9552cb269d475.avif?t=1772087423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras_big/3f0e1ba76b5bb243e0f9552cb269d475.avif?t=1772087423 width=800 height=372 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Meditative Soundscape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanied by original gentle music and ambient sound design, the experience invites players to slow down, feel, and remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras/bc20e5763dd8a0f49d97ebe2a799e923.avif?t=1772087423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras_big/bc20e5763dd8a0f49d97ebe2a799e923.avif?t=1772087423 width=800 height=368 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you appreciate <strong>narrative-driven games</strong> like <i>What Remains of Edith Finch</i>, <i>Gone Home</i>, or <i>To the Moon</i>, <i>The Falling Star</i> offers a similarly heartfelt tale in a compact and accessible format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat. No time limits. Just you, your memories, and the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase the star, while you still can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras/c3ad1800a4663645b7cb6600d6841d46.avif?t=1772087423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/extras_big/c3ad1800a4663645b7cb6600d6841d46.avif?t=1772087423 width=800 height=372 /></span></p>","developers":["Yeariver"],"dlc":[4048290,4047960],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706430/4c78f899c45958e5bc47c7ba4525c2409c719742/header.jpg?t=1772087423","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3706430/2072950354/c19523e3ccbe2460d12f24c37113d84e212b88aa/1768622679/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768623585","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3706430/2072950354/c19523e3ccbe2460d12f24c37113d84e212b88aa/1768622679/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768623585","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3706430/2072950354/c19523e3ccbe2460d12f24c37113d84e212b88aa/1768622679/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768623585","id":257266587,"name":"CinematicTeaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257266587/b721d5a1c2c1bdda9dea4370e53b9ed946adc11c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768623585"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3706430/882018/e79ff363b82a3